WEBVTT

00:00:00.453 --> 00:00:01.181
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:02.127 --> 00:00:06.169
Being imprecise about quantity and time

00:00:07.258 --> 00:00:09.701
<v><b>A:</b></v> How many people were there at the demonstration?

00:00:09.845 --> 00:00:11.868
<v><b>B:</b></v> Oh, around 500.

00:00:12.890 --> 00:00:14.864
<v><b>A:</b></v> There must have been 500 or so.

00:00:15.935 --> 00:00:17.279
<v><b>B:</b></v> Maybe 500-odd?

00:00:18.245 --> 00:00:22.000
<v><b>A:</b></v> At least 450, and at most 525.

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:25.111
<v><b>A:</b></v> How old were most of the demonstrators?

00:00:25.350 --> 00:00:26.874
<v><b>B:</b></v> Oh, 20-something, I’d say.